    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Samantha",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103645031944496209369/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLOTTdqoV9SDbgnY26nVNcSCgoUrvzCorq0llZfW1b-CFxfAT0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "As tenants in a 6-plex using this snow removal service, we are extremely frustrated with their lack of reliability. They often come at inconvenient hours (5 AM or past 10 PM) when most residents are home, and we still end up shoveling ourselves despite paying for the service.\n\nAfter a heavy snowfall today, we took extra steps to make their job easier—clearing the bins, placing them out of the way, and marking the concrete rises for visibility. Yet, only half the driveway was cleared, leaving us to deal with large snow piles just to get to work and also replace the bins.\n\nThis is a clear disregard for their contracted responsibilities. Completely unacceptable. 1 star.",
        "time": 1739762052,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Juls007 B.",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116195768679777463886/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocInLn71O_RaR9tdKesN01IgutUgFHMOKjJNlsxrXxYwib5YjA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "12 months ago",
        "text": "We live in ile-Perrot and have been clients for 4 consecutive years. Outstanding service by a mature and dedicated driver. He goes above and beyond and we appreciate it very much. I would like to add that the drivers can only do so much if people don't move their vehicles or wait extended time to do so. The obstacles are there but he's always in great spirits 🙂",
        "time": 1739899782,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nitya Nundy",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103376518242332222690/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUiFpLdwAue1aNkn2SOzmMNmYsN6nOtE-njqMB3UHU9lbGfmZod=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "As residents of Ile Perrot we are very satisfied with Ottingers snow removal service.  On our  second season with them, I asked if they could come back out to remark the designated snow removal area according to our contract.  Louise and her team happily obliged and Cedric was at the house minutes later to do the job. He was professional and courteous.  Thank you Ottinger for your services coming up this winter.  We wish you a successful season and stay safe.",
        "time": 1729174248,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "regina planer",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118287529040573225396/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKVZ_P3ShNRdjNEbnsaxMkEAJWLlbz90yvX09kexTmHmXTTUg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "Thank you very much for the excellent  service.The driver who works down Rousseau  a thumbs up.Hope to see this driver again next year.My husband  and I are so so happy  with Ottinger",
        "time": 1741102621,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "andrew caterin",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116793535352094974693/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKDBe24ahgaHNiktgBFuIkjma4lj1eJc0xQP5aRQHR4ucirkQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "Excellent, well managed company! I’ve had a snow contract with them for many years and never had any issues. My driveway is spotless, even after the most recent snow storm. I highly recommend their services!",
